@startuml mo_senate_topics
title mo_senate_topics: MO Senate topical index
start
:owned years of the lookback window
(one unit per regular session);
:GET senate.mo.gov/BillTracking/bills/keywords?year=YYYY&session=R
(3-6 MB; current year daily, past years monthly);
note right
  Extraordinary sessions have no index
  (the page comes back empty).
end note
:split at each keyword heading;
:one row per (keyword, bill card):
bill label, link, description, sponsors;
:mo_senate_bill_topics;
:dbt: stg_mo_senate__bill_topics
(keyword -> House subject spelling)
-> int_bills__subjects (House terms win for a House bill)
-> fct_bill_subjects, fct_bills (Senate bills), fct_vote_bills;
stop
@enduml
